# BuildKit reads this file (not a root .dockerignore) for
# containers/Dockerfile.cp2k because it sits next to the Dockerfile and is
# named <Dockerfile>.dockerignore. The build context is the repository root, so
# the file is an allowlist: everything is excluded except what the Dockerfile
# COPYs. CP2K source is fetched at the pinned commit inside the build.
*
!containers/scripts/validate_cp2k_stack.py
!containers/probes/cp2k
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.DS_Store
